# LLM Arena (separate project)
# Keep generate_lore_pdf.py but ignore its output is already tracked

# --- Audio: purchased packs, licensed to the owner only, NOT distributed ---
# See assets/ASSETS_PLACEHOLDER.md. The game runs silent without them.
*.ogg
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.m4a

# --- Images: ignored by default so stray screenshots/downloads stay out ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tga

# Exception: assets/sprites/ is the project's OWN art — AI-generated for this
# project and regenerable via tools/comfyui + tools/slice_sprites.py. It ships
# with the repo. Audio above stays excluded.
!assets/sprites/**/*.png

# Acceptance simulation batch logs (tools/run_acceptance.ps1)
_simruns/

# Dev panel screenshots (tools/collect_uishots.ps1)
_uishots/
